      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "team_0190_botan_12",
      "hash64": "5712BB0133B376CC",
      "text": "怎麼謝[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳都不夠。\\n所以，[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳收下這個吧……[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
